cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below.
title: "Domino and Domicule Tilings: exact counts, numbering and sampling"
abstract: >-
  Exact counts of domino tilings (OEIS A004003) and domicule tilings (OEIS A239264, A239273)
  of rectangular boards: the domino product formula evaluated as a resultant of integer
  polynomials, transfer-matrix dynamic programming, a modular solver with the Chinese
  remainder theorem, numbering and sampling of individual tilings, and PARI/GP programs.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ryłko
    given-names: Dawid
    website: https://dawidrylko.com
repository-code: https://github.com/dawidrylko/domino-tiling
url: https://dawidrylko.github.io/domino-tiling/
license: MIT
keywords:
  - domino tiling
  - dimer coverings
  - domicule tiling
  - king's graph
  - perfect matchings
  - OEIS A004003
  - OEIS A239273
  - OEIS A239264
  - resultant
  - transfer matrix
  - Chinese remainder theorem
  - PARI/GP
